    prompt: `Write a Livly security and compliance one-pager for IT directors and CIOs evaluating the platform. Cover: (1) Data hosting — where resident and operational data is stored, what cloud provider, what region, (2) Encryption — in transit and at rest, what standards, (3) Authentication — SSO support, MFA requirements, session management, (4) Access control — role-based permissions, audit logging, who can see what, (5) Compliance — SOC 2 status, GDPR/CCPA compliance posture, (6) PMS integration security — how the Yardi/Entrata sync works, what credentials are used, what data is accessed, (7) Incident response — what happens if there's a breach, notification timeline, (8) Penetration testing — frequency and third-party involvement. Note: I will fill in actual compliance certification details. Write placeholders where specific claims require verification. Tone: factual and confident without overclaiming.`,
