    rock: 'r2',
    item: 'Implementation timeline overview',
    title: 'Implementation timeline',
    prompt: `Write a visual implementation timeline for Livly onboarding — a one-page document that shows operators exactly what to expect from contract signing to full deployment. Structure as a 4-week milestone chart:\n\nWeek 1: Contract signed, technical kickoff call, PMS sync credentials shared, Hub environment configured.\nWeek 2: PMS integration live, Hub access provisioned for property team, staff training call.\nWeek 3: Resident invitation wave sent, AI Concierge configured with property data, first conversations live.\nWeek 4: Go-live review call, adoption metrics reviewed, 30-day success criteria confirmed.\n\nPost-launch: 30-day check-in, 90-day QBR, ongoing CS cadence.\n\nFor each milestone: what Livly does, what the customer does, and what "done" looks like. Also include: what can delay the timeline (PMS access issues, low staff engagement, data quality problems) and how we handle each. This should feel reassuring, not bureaucratic.`,
