    rock: 'r2',
    item: 'Integration and technical spec sheet',
    title: 'Technical integration spec sheet',
    prompt: `Write a Livly technical integration specification sheet for IT directors and systems integrators evaluating a Livly deployment. Cover: (1) API overview — REST API, authentication method (OAuth 2.0, API key), rate limits, versioning policy, (2) PMS integrations — Yardi Voyager, Entrata, AppFolio, RealPage — what data syncs, sync frequency, sync direction (bidirectional vs one-way), what's required from the PMS side, (3) Hardware integrations — Comelit intercom, Dormakaba, Schlage, Assa Abloy — BLE protocol, credential format, firmware requirements, (4) Data model overview — what a resident record looks like, what a unit record includes, how leases sync, (5) Webhooks — available events, payload format, retry behavior, (6) Sandbox environment — availability, data seeding, testing process, (7) Support for integration — who to contact, typical integration timeline, what documentation exists. Write placeholders where specific technical details need to be confirmed with engineering.`,
